# Kernel configuration fragment of the coverage job (.github/workflows/coverage.yml, security
# roadmap S17, journal 0247), appended to vm/kasan.config: gcov support in the kernel, so that a
# module built with GCOV_PROFILE=y exports its counters under /sys/kernel/debug/gcov
# (Documentation/dev-tools/gcov.rst). The kernel itself is not profiled. Data of an unloaded
# module is kept and added to on reload (gcov_persist=1, the default), so the counts cover
# every load of the layer during the suite.
CONFIG_GCOV_KERNEL=y
# CONFIG_GCOV_PROFILE_ALL is not set
